60\u00b0 Live-Streams in 3D - als w\u00e4rst du selbst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_I1NauQ0y34Q7kNvwH5ksJD&_nc_oc=Adq6WaYQXO0dtfvqcfbZyCvenTyE2RU2VqwAKtDksazTAqpNJ8LOS-Bm53ZHa3sdS3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2JVcysm6otRd4Um6x5cqGiFKEncilybpNSs5ZdipiCWw&oe=69DE2F56"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V2B6sXBU-FEQ7kNvwFIw3D5&_nc_oc=AdrP25E09thRPebr2w2GxETQUElgqcBAgfQSV_DlDrXrHakHD9q4rgyvmc7q6f9Lbt4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3a6am97ivhYXdxG-wvuyLZOwn4ebkqjViMR0Byhc5_eA&oe=69DE392D"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SBvTtMd1rJYQ7kNvwEdAl1x&_nc_oc=Adrfaew7APxAF7XJUpcwbIPfniQoLxWn9c4y7GWrm5oqCxerwvw4rfiQUNBfNIN7OjE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0-86egwJv3aHbjXqAxm2Z3hG2DT7qjaqquo40rfQN7Rw&oe=69DE316D"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_c